{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":38,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["希西家王的疾病和痊愈"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时希西家病得要死，亚摩斯的儿子先知以赛亚去见他，对他说：「耶和华如此说：你当留遗命与你的家，因为你必死不能活了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西家就转脸朝墙，祷告耶和华说："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「耶和华啊，求你记念我在你面前怎样存完全的心，按诚实行事，又做你眼中所看为善的。」希西家就痛哭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华的话临到以赛亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你去告诉希西家说，耶和华—你祖大卫的 神如此说：我听见了你的祷告，看见了你的眼泪。我必加增你十五年的寿数；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["并且我要救你和这城脱离亚述王的手，也要保护这城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「我—耶和华必成就我所说的。我先给你一个兆头，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["就是叫亚哈斯的日晷，向前进的日影往后退十度。」于是，前进的日影果然在日晷上往后退了十度。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"犹大王希西家患病已经痊愈，就作诗说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说：正在我中年","poem":1},{"noteId":33},{"text":"之日","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必进入阴间的门；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我余剩的年岁不得享受。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说：我必不得见耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在活人之地不见耶和华；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我与世上的居民不再见面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的住处被迁去离开我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像牧人的帐棚一样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我将性命卷起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像织布的卷布一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必将我从机头剪断，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从早到晚，他要使我完结。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使自己安静直到天亮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像狮子折断我一切的骨头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从早到晚，他要使我完结。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"我像燕子呢喃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像白鹤鸣叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像鸽子哀鸣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因仰观，眼睛困倦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，我受欺压，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你为我作保。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可说什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他应许我的，也给我成就了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因心里的苦楚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在一生的年日必悄悄而行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"主啊，人得存活乃在乎此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我灵存活也全在此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以求你使我痊愈，仍然存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我受大苦，本为使我得平安；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因爱我的灵魂","poem":1},{"noteId":34},{"text":"便救我脱离败坏的坑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你将我一切的罪扔在你的背后。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原来，阴间不能称谢你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡不能颂扬你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下坑的人不能盼望你的诚实。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有活人，活人必称谢你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像我今日称谢你一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为父的，必使儿女知道你的诚实。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和华肯救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我们要一生一世","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶和华殿中","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用丝弦的乐器唱我的诗歌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["以赛亚说：「当取一块无花果饼来，贴在疮上，王必痊愈。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["希西家问说：「我能上耶和华的殿，有什么兆头呢？」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":33,"caller":"-","text":"或译：晌午","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":10}},{"noteId":34,"caller":"-","text":"或译：生命","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/38.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/39.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/37.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}